---
description: NDDev setup manager authoring and validation policy
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep setup-manager changes target-explicit and reversible.
- Preserve unmanaged Cursor state and co-owned CLI configuration keys.
- Treat native Cursor plugin, rules, skills, agents, and commands files as the builder projection.
- Use only the active NDDev setup/profile contract: setup `nddev-builder` plus profile `full-auto` or `safe`.
- Do not add unsupported profile or operating-system contract names.
- Keep hooks and MCP as design-only unless a later setup explicitly owns executable hook or MCP configuration.
- Do not provision team marketplace state from this local setup manager.
